                        "description": {
                          "en": "The High Priestess, the Pope Joan, or Female Pontiff. She is the Secret Tradition and the higher sense of the instituted Mysteries. She represents the spiritual Bride and Mother, the Queen of the Borrowed Light, but this is the light of all. She is seated between the white and black pillars—J. and B.—of the mystic Temple.",
                          "zh-CN": "她端坐于黑白双柱(J和B)之间,象征着二元对立中的完美平衡 。她身后的帷幕上绣着棕榈与石榴,遮蔽着凡人不可直视的深层真理 。她头戴有角的月冠,脚踏新月,胸前有太阳十字 ,手中紧握神秘卷轴“Tora”,那是神圣律法的象征 。她是通往隐秘智慧的守门人 ,代表着直觉、潜意识以及那寂静之中流淌的灵性之光。她的最高阶名字是 Shekinah,象征内住的荣耀 。"
                        },
                        "meanings": {
                          "upright": {
                            "en": "Intelligence and excellent judgment; insight and foresight; strong will to fight; calm leadership; luck in study, research, and spiritual matters; an independent woman; platonic love; a deeply connected spiritual friend; a cool or restrained romance; secrets; mystery; wisdom; science; silence; resilience",
                            "zh-CN": "知性、优秀的判断力; 具洞察力及先见之明; 强大的战斗意志; 冷静的统率力; 学问、研究等精神方面幸运; 独立自主的女性; 柏拉图式的爱情; 有心灵上交往至深的友人; 冷淡的恋情; 秘密; 奥秘; 智慧; 科学; 沉默; 坚韧 "
                          },
                          "reversed": {
                            "en": "Ignorance and lack of understanding; insufficient study; irrational attitude; self-isolation; nervousness; excessive fastidiousness; conflict with female friends; coldness toward others; late marriage or celibacy; unrequited love without result; infertility; passion; moral or physical ardor; conceit; superficial knowledge",
                            "zh-CN": "无知、缺乏理解力; 研究不足; 不理性的态度; 自我封闭; 神经质; 洁癖; 与女性朋友起争执; 对人冷淡; 晚婚或独身主义; 没有结果的单相思; 不孕; 激情; 道德或肉体上的热情; 自负; 表面知识 "
                          }
